summary:
  The ground under the line on the cover lets most of the picture through.

history:
  The line lies on a picture of any colour, a white sleeve among them.
  Its own dark ground at 0.72 keeps white letters at 9.3 to 1 there. At 0.3
  the same letters on a white sleeve read under 2 to 1. This mutant thins
  the ground.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverNote.qml

find:
      color: Qt.rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72)

replace:
      color: Qt.rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_covernote.qml::test_the_words_read_on_any_picture.
  Line-neutral.
